### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{dy}{dx}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left(\ln(\sin(x))\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=\sin(x)\text{, }v(x)=\ln(x)}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{\dfrac{1}{\sin(x)}}\cdot\maroonC{\cos(x)}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{\cos(x)}{\sin(x)}
\end{align}$
